Abu
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 64 ROTATE 3 U 3
HAIGA 8 FACE_HALF
HAIGA 4 FACE_HALF
HAIGA 10 FACE_HALF
HAIGA 9 FACE_HALF
HAIGA 7 FACE_HALF

BRIB 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DRAW BRIB
AND
    AND
        DEST Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS, CLUBS, SPADES}
        SRC Rank K
    OR
        DEST Suit {CLUBS}
        DEST Rank 1
MOVE BRIB BRIB
DESTSRC Rank add_13
MOVE_STACK HAIGA HAIGA
DEST Size >= 5
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL HAIGA Empty
